:INFO
Art. 59 Repeal of other legislation
The following ordinances are repealed:
1. the STSB Organisation Ordinance of 23 March 2011;
2. the Accident Investigation Ordinance of 28 June 2000;
3. Ordinance of 23 November 1994 on the Investigation of Aviation Accidents and Serious Incidents.
|

:NOTE
let. 1 — [AS 2011 4589, 4573 art. 2 let. a]
let. 2 — [AS 2000 2103; 2006 4705 n. II 68; 2011 4573 art. 2 let. 6, 4575]
let. 3 — [AS 1994 3037; 1999 2495; 2011 4573 art. 2 let. c, 4579]
|

:INFO
Art. 60 Amendment of other legislation
The amendment of other legislation is regulated in the Annex.
|

:INFO
Art. 60a Transitional provision to the Amendment of 13 September 2024
Results of investigations into incidents that took place before the Amendment of 13 September 2024 came into force may be summarised and published in accordance with the reporting requirements in force when the incident occurred.
|

:NOTE
Art. 60a — Inserted by No I of the O of 10 April 2024, in force since 1 July 2024 (AS 2024 182).
|

:INFO
Art. 61 Commencement
This Ordinance comes into force on 1 February 2015.

